{title: You’re gonna make it}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/You’re gonna make it.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
You’re gonna make it, you’re gonna make it.
You’ve got what it takes to win.
Oh, I know that you’re gonna make it, you’re gonna make it
Just as long as you and Jesus stay friends.

{comment: Verse 1}
Only the strong are gonna make it,
Only the brave are gonna win.
So fight till you can’t fight any longer,
Then stand up and fight again.
Jesus knew you had what it takes to make it,
That’s the reason why He called your name.
He knew you’d love Him in the sunshine,
Now He’s hoping you’ll love Him in the rain.
And you and He together can win over and over again.
